# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not add or expand questions</b>. Instead either edit the "
"question or add a question comment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne trebaju dodavati ili proširivati pitanja</b>. Umjesto toga "
"uredite pitanje ili dodajte komentar na pitanje."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not add or expand questions</b>. Instead, either edit the "
"question or add a comment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne trebaju dodavati ili proširivati pitanja</b>. Umjesto toga, "
"uredite pitanje ili dodajte komentar."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not comment other answers</b>. Instead add a comment on "
"the other answers."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovor ne treba komentirati druge odgovore</b>. Umjesto toga dodajte "
"komentar na druge odgovore."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers should not start debates</b> This community Q&amp;A is not a "
"discussion group. Please avoid holding debates in your answers as they tend "
"to dilute the essence of questions and answers. For brief discussions please"
" use commenting facility."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne trebaju pokretati debate</b> Ova zajednica Q&A nije "
"diskusijska grupa. Molimo izbjegavajte vođenje debata u vašim odgovorima jer"
" imaju tendenciju razrjeđivanja suštine pitanja i odgovora. Za kratke "
"rasprave molimo koristite funkciju komentiranja."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just point to other Questions</b>. Instead add a "
"question comment indication \"Possible duplicate of...\". However, it's ok "
"to include links to other questions or answers providing relevant additional"
" information."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne trebaju samo usmjeriti na druga pitanja</b>. Umjesto toga "
"dodajte komentar na pitanje s oznakom \"Mogući duplikat od...\". Međutim, u "
"redu je uključiti linkove na druga pitanja ili odgovore koji pružaju "
"relevantne dodatne informacije."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just point to other questions</b>.Instead add a comment"
" indicating <i>\"Possible duplicate of...\"</i>. However, it's fine to "
"include links to other questions or answers providing relevant additional "
"information."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne trebaju samo usmjeriti na druga pitanja</b>. Umjesto toga "
"dodajte komentar s oznakom <i>\"Mogući duplikat od...\"</i>. Međutim, u redu"
" je uključiti linkove na druga pitanja ili odgovore koji pružaju relevantne "
"dodatne informacije."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Answers shouldn't just provide a link a solution</b>. Instead provide the"
" solution description text in your answer, even if it's just a copy/paste. "
"Links are welcome, but should be complementary to answer, referring sources "
"or additional reading."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odgovori ne trebaju samo pružiti link na rješenje</b>. Umjesto toga "
"unesite tekst opisa rješenja u svoj odgovor, čak i ako je samo "
"kopiranje/lijepljenje. Linkovi su dobrodošli, ali trebaju biti dopunski "
"odgovoru, pozivajući se na izvore ili dodatno čitanje."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Before you ask - please make sure to search for a similar question.</b> "
"You can search questions by their title or tags. It’s also OK to answer your"
" own question."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prije postavljanja pitanja - molimo provjerite da nema sličnog "
"pitanja.</b> Možete pretraživati pitanja po naslovu ili oznakama. Također je"
" u redu odgovoriti na vlastito pitanje."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Please avoid asking questions that are too subjective and "
"argumentative</b> or not relevant to this community."
msgstr ""
"<b>Molimo izbjegavajte postavljanje pitanja koja su previše subjektivna i "
"sporena</b> ili nisu relevantna za ovu zajednicu."

