msgid ""
"The goal of this site is create a relevant knowledge base that would answer "
"questions related to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Cilj ove stranice je stvoriti relevantnu bazu znanja koja će odgovoriti na "
"pitanja vezana za Odoo."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"Therefore questions and answers can be edited like wiki pages by experienced"
" users of this site in order to improve the overall quality of the knowledge"
" base content. Such privileges are granted based on user karma level: you "
"will be able to do the same once your karma gets high enough."
msgstr ""
"Stoga pitanja i odgovori mogu biti uređivani kao wiki stranice od strane "
"iskusnih korisnika ove stranice radi poboljšanja ukupne kvalitete sadržaja "
"baze znanja. Takve privilegije se dodjeljuju na osnovu korisničke razine "
"karme: moći ćete činiti isto kad vaša karma postane dovoljno visoka."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
