# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"When a question or answer is upvoted, the user who posted them will gain "
"some points, which are called \"karma points\". These points serve as a "
"rough measure of the community trust to him/her. Various moderation tasks "
"are gradually assigned to the users based on those points."
msgstr ""
"Kada se pitanje ili odgovor pozitivno ocijeni, korisnik koji ih je objavio "
"dobit će neke bodove, koji se nazivaju \"karma bodovi\". Ti bodovi služe kao"
" gruba mjera povjerenja zajednice prema njemu/njoj. Različiti moderacijski "
"zadaci se postupno dodjeljuju korisnicima na osnovu tih bodova."

# model:
# model_terms:forum.forum,faq:website_slides_forum.forum_forum_demo_channel_0
#, []
msgid ""
"You should only ask practical, answerable questions based on actual problems"
" that you face. Chatty, open-ended questions diminish the usefulness of this"
" site and push other questions off the front page."
msgstr ""
"Trebate postaviti samo praktična, odgovoriva pitanja temeljena na stvarnim "
"problemima s kojima se suočavate. Ćaskava, otvorena pitanja smanjuju "
"korisnost ove stranice i guraju druga pitanja s prve stranice."

